From ad80673e9e729d8b7a12d4f38e917a25aeea343a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Apr 2026 19:04:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] feat(feishu): native reply dispatcher with streaming
 cards, thinking panels, and tool tracking

- Add native reply dispatcher with full streaming card lifecycle
- Integrate CLI stream-json mode with streaming cards
- Migrate streaming-card from raw HTTP to Lark SDK with Card Kit API
- Implement collapsible thinking panel in streaming cards
- Track tool execution by count with dynamic panel display
- Dedupe final card replies (onIdle/deliver race, hook rewrites, mention variants)
- Renew streaming_mode every 8 min to prevent Feishu 10-min timeout
- Recover streaming cards after timeout and detect closed streaming mode
- Force final card sync after stream failures
- Accumulate thinking panel updates and preserve hook metadata
- Normalize card mentions before send and persist in final card
- Support media/image content in streaming card output
- Register createFeishuReplyDispatcher on plugin runtime

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
